# Build artifacts.
/.lake/
*.olean
*.ilean
*.trace
/build/

# Throwaway probes and one-off `example`s used while chasing an elaboration or instance
# problem. Ignored rather than merely untracked because parallel sessions share this clone:
# a stray `git add -A` in one session sweeps up another's half-written scratch file and
# lands it under the wrong commit message. That has happened once already -- 5317c4b carries
# CONTRIBUTING.md and all of docbuild/ under a message about the affine-local criterion.
# CONTRIBUTING.md asks you to stage by path, which prevents this; ignoring the directory
# means forgetting cannot.
#
# Nothing here is ever meant to ship. A probe worth keeping belongs in CohLean/ with a
# module docstring, or -- if it is a dead end -- written up as prose in the file it came
# from, the way PresentationIsFinite.lean records what its retry ruled out.
/scratch/

# Planning and session handoffs live in the issue tracker or external notes.
HANDOFF.md
ROADMAP.md
